## The Label Contract — Who Owns What

Labels are the API between agents. Never set a label you don't own.

```
PM Agent owns:                    Engineering Agent reacts to:
─────────────────────────────     ────────────────────────────
status: backlog                   (ignores)
status: refinement                (ignores)
status: ready-for-eng       ───►  TRIGGER: Eng Agent picks up
                                  
Engineering Agent sets:           PM Agent reacts to:
────────────────────────────      ─────────────────────────────
status: in-progress         ───►  Move board card
status: in-review           ───►  Move card + notify Slack
status: done                ───►  Close issue + update milestone
status: blocked             ───►  Escalate in Slack (either agent can set)
status: needs-clarification ───►  PM re-opens for scoping
```

