## Multi-Repo Setup

This system runs across multiple repos. Each repo has:

```
your-repo/
├── .cursor/
│   └── rules/
│       ├── 00-coordination.mdc    ← copy from agent-workflow/ (this file)
│       ├── pm-agent.mdc           ← copy from agent-workflow/
│       ├── eng-agent.mdc          ← copy from agent-workflow/
│       ├── review-agent.mdc       ← copy from agent-workflow/
│       └── project-context.mdc    ← THIS REPO ONLY, fill in per project
├── .github/
│   ├── ISSUE_TEMPLATE/
│   └── pull_request_template.md
└── AGENTS.md
```

`project-context.mdc` is the only file that differs per repo.
All other rules files are identical copies — update agent-workflow/, then sync.

