## Shared GitHub Label Set

Run this once per repo to create all required labels:

```bash
# Status labels
gh label create "status: backlog"            --color "#e2e2e2"
gh label create "status: refinement"         --color "#f9d71c"
gh label create "status: ready-for-eng"      --color "#0075ca"
gh label create "status: in-progress"        --color "#ff9900"
gh label create "status: in-review"          --color "#8b5cf6"
gh label create "status: done"               --color "#2ea44f"
gh label create "status: blocked"            --color "#d73a49"
gh label create "status: needs-clarification" --color "#e4e669"

# Type labels
gh label create "type: feature"   --color "#a2eeef"
gh label create "type: bug"       --color "#d73a49"
gh label create "type: chore"     --color "#fef2c0"
gh label create "type: spike"     --color "#c5def5"
gh label create "type: epic"      --color "#3e4b9e"

# Priority labels
gh label create "priority: P0"    --color "#b60205"
gh label create "priority: P1"    --color "#e4432b"
gh label create "priority: P2"    --color "#f99a2b"
gh label create "priority: P3"    --color "#fce89a"
```

