## Slack Message Format

All agent Slack messages follow this structure so they're scannable:

```
[EMOJI] [AGENT] | [ACTION] | #[issue-number] [title]
[one line of context]
[link if applicable]
```

Examples:
```
🔵 PM Agent | Issue Ready | #42 Add JWT refresh endpoint
Priority: P1 · Sprint 3 · Waiting for eng pickup
https://github.com/org/repo/issues/42

⚙️ Eng Agent | Work Started | #42 Add JWT refresh endpoint  
Branch: feat/issue-42-jwt-refresh · Est: M
https://github.com/org/repo/tree/feat/issue-42-jwt-refresh

🔍 Review Agent | PR Reviewed | #42 → PR #18
2 warnings · 0 blockers · All ACs covered
https://github.com/org/repo/pull/18
```

